# Tribunal "Scroll Sales": Ten-Tongues Weerhat at the Pawnbroker sells cheap
# scrolls. At disposition 60 she mentions the offers (10); at 70, asking where
# they come from (choice 3) logs 20 and names Ahnia; at 85 she admits Ahnia's
# hideout in the Bazaar Sewers (30, ScrollSales). Reading Ahnia's note there
# logs 35 and Ahnia force-greets (AhniaNote); the note ("Book Menu") opens under
# her greeting. Her death logs 40 (AhniaDead).
# Ten-Tongues then hands over Elbert Nermarc's stolen notes (60), and Elbert,
# given them back, logs 100.
# Bribes, repeated until they land, raise Ten-Tongues from her base 50; the kill
# stands in for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ms_job_hunt --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ms_scroll_sales
run
player->PositionCell -29 203 -365 0 "Mournhold, Pawnbroker"
until 600 "Ten-Tongues_Weerhat"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Ten-Tongues_Weerhat
persuade bribe100 until "Ten-Tongues_Weerhat"->GetDisposition >= 85
ask Special Offers
expect GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales >= 10
ask Special Offers
choose 3
expect GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales == 20
ask Ahnia
expect GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales == 30
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1460 -2200 -255 0 "Old Mournhold: Bazaar Sewers"
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Bazaar Sewers" == 1
until 600 "bk_ahnia"->GetDisabled == 0
activate 062188FE
until 300 GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales == 35
until 600 MenuMode == 1
bye
close Book Menu
defend
console 069F29B0.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales == 40
run
player->PositionCell -29 203 -365 0 "Mournhold, Pawnbroker"
until 600 "Ten-Tongues_Weerhat"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Ten-Tongues_Weerhat
ask Ahnia
expect GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales == 60
expect player->GetItemCount "bk_nermarcnotes" == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell 100 0 146 0 "Mournhold, Craftsmen's Hall"
until 600 "Elbert Nermarc"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Elbert Nermarc
ask stolen book
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex MS_ScrollSales == 100
bye
end
